================================================================================
## Fix Explorer sandbox load SQL
================================================================================

Context: Picking a ready simulation in Explorer failed with "Error filtering
the triple store". The sandbox path called GraphFilter.expand at depth 0;
Lakebase wrapped that SELECT in adjacency CTEs and Postgres rejected
``WITH adj_out AS (...), SELECT ...``.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graphdb/lakebase/LakebaseFlatStore.py
   Depth-0 SPO expand is a plain SELECT; do not prefix adjacency CTEs.
2. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/explorer/GraphFilter.py
   sandbox_slice fetches the sandbox triples directly (no expand hop).
3. tests/units/graphdb/test_lakebase_adjacency.py
   Depth-0 SPO SQL starts with SELECT and has no WITH adj_out.
4. tests/units/graphdb/test_v090_graph_access_filter.py
   sandbox_slice must not call expand_and_fetch_subgraph.

