================================================================================
## Fire ticked SWRL after simulation hypotheses
================================================================================

Context: With SWRL ticked on a scenario, attach-meter still did not run
after extra contracts were added. The runner called SWRL, but extra
contracts were copied without their meter subjects, so the join had
nothing to match. Re-seeding the patched customer from live after a Set
would also restore the old value.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/simulation/SimulationSandbox.py
   After seeding, walk sandbox URI objects (and live expand) for two hops
   so meters of extra contracts are copied.
2. src/back/objects/simulation/SimulationRunner.py
   Seed every hypothesis URI at 2 hops before the before-picture; after
   apply, copy objects of new links only (not the patched subjects).
3. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/models.py
   DomainSnapshot falls back to ontology.swrl_rules / classes / properties.
4. tests/units/simulation/test_simulation_core.py
   Empty live expand still seeds meter objects; snapshot loads SWRL.
5. tests/units/simulation/test_simulation_runner_api.py
   Hypothesis neighbourhood is copied at 2 hops.
6. docs/user-guide.md
   Ticked SWRL runs after hypotheses; extra entities bring two hops.

